# MetroCIM lives in Export/

All add-in code, docs, installers, and detailed project rules are under `Export/`.

Follow these files (read them when working on this repo):

- [Export/rules/01-overview.md](../../Export/rules/01-overview.md) — goal, hosts, ribbon, coords, non-goals
- [Export/rules/02-architecture.md](../../Export/rules/02-architecture.md) — layout, Core/Revit/NW, packaging
- [Export/rules/03-tasks.md](../../Export/rules/03-tasks.md) — done vs remaining work
- [Export/README.md](../../Export/README.md) — install, deploy, build

Current product shape: four ribbon commands (glTF, XKT, IFC, Excel) on Revit and Navisworks 2025–2027; Local/Shared for mesh exports; separate per-user NSIS installers.

Layout:

```text
Export/
  Core/  Revit/  Navisworks/  Tests/  installer/  docs/  rules/
```
